    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Online type foundry operated within ECAL (Ecole cantonale d arts de Lausanne), Switzerland, distributing typefaces designed by ECAL students (Bachelor Graphic Design and Master Type Design). Running since 2016 as one of the first university-based online foundries, in association with Swiss Typefaces. Catalogue of ~20 student typefaces (e.g. Maskots, Parabole, Yanagi). Not a person; an institutional foundry, so seniority/autonomy do not apply in the usual sense. Type design teaching reputation is strong (Rappo, Party, Bilak as lecturers). Instagram @ecal_ch is the school account (no dedicated foundry IG found). LinkedIn: no dedicated foundry profile; parent school ECAL has linkedin.com/school/ecal but it belongs to the institution not the foundry sub-unit, so not attached.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-06-23T00:54:49",
